source_cn:
提高角色伤害命中后暴击的概率（命中后的暴击率不会高于75%），触发暴击时伤害将提高一定倍率。
造成治疗不会暴击。

角色物理暴击：{*d,F1690001,pCrit}
角色魔法暴击：{*d,F1690001,mCrit}

ref_en:
Increases the probability of a critical hit after the character's damage hits (the critical hit rate after hitting will not be higher than 75%). When a critical hit is triggered, the damage will be increased by a certain multiplier. 
 Healing does not trigger critical hits. 

 Character Physical Critical Hit: {*d,F1690001,pCrit} 
 Character Magic Critical Hit: {*d,F1690001,mCrit}

